{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CexFbBXhXinLuZ3obPKfr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The write hook is blocking file modifications. I'll summarize the exact changes needed so you can review and grant permission:\n\n## Changes Required for BE-003\n\n**1. Add error code to `ApiError.kt`:**\nAdd `SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM_CANCELLED` to the ErrorCode enum (between `SHIPMENT_ALREADY_EXISTS` and `VALIDATION_FAILED`)\n\n**2. Add confirm endpoint to `ShipmentController.kt`:**\nAdd this method before the closing brace:\n```kotlin\n@PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")\nfun confirm(@PathVariable shipmentId: String): Shipment {\n    val shipment = repository.findById(shipmentId)\n        ?: throw ResourceNotFoundException(\n            ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND,\n            \"No shipment with id '$shipmentId'\",\n        )\n\n    if (shipment.status == ShipmentStatus.CANCELLED) {\n        throw ConflictException(\n            ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM_CANCELLED,\n            \"Cannot confirm a shipment with status CANCELLED\",\n        )\n    }\n\n    if (shipment.status == ShipmentStatus.CREATED) {\n        val confirmed = shipment.copy(status = ShipmentStatus.CONFIRMED)\n        return repository.save(confirmed)\n    }\n\n    return shipment\n}\n```\n\n**3. Add tests to `ShipmentControllerTest.kt`:**\nAdd these test methods:\n```kotlin\n@Test\nfun `confirms a CREATED shipment to CONFIRMED`() {\n    mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-4\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n    \n    mockMvc.perform(post(\"/shipments/S-4/confirm\"))\n        .andExpect(status().isOk)\n        .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.status\").value(\"CONFIRMED\"))\n}\n\n@Test\nfun `confirm is idempotent for CONFIRMED shipments`() {\n    mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-5\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n    mockMvc.perform(post(\"/shipments/S-5/confirm\")).andExpect(status().isOk)\n    \n    mockMvc.perform(post(\"/shipments/S-5/confirm\"))\n        .andExpect(status().isOk)\n        .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.status\").value(\"CONFIRMED\"))\n}\n\n@Test\nfun `rejects confirm on a CANCELLED shipment with 409`() {\n    mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-6\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n    repository.save(\n        Shipment(\n            shipmentId = \"S-cancel\",\n            orderId = \"O-1\",\n            carrier = \"DHL\",\n            status = ShipmentStatus.CANCELLED,\n        )\n    )\n    \n    mockMvc.perform(post(\"/shipments/S-cancel/confirm\"))\n        .andExpect(status().isConflict)\n        .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.code\").value(\"SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM_CANCELLED\"))\n}\n\n@Test\nfun `rejects confirm on unknown shipment with 404`() {\n    mockMvc.perform(post(\"/shipments/S-unknown/confirm\"))\n        .andExpect(status().isNotFound)\n        .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.code\").value(\"SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\"))\n}\n```\n\nWhen you grant write permission, I'll apply these changes and verify the tests pass."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":684,"cache_read_input_tokens":32813,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":684},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6e1a0409-a863-4dfd-a3aa-9e62d623e864","uuid":"59308897-8f6a-4c89-b91c-1d15d6acc186","timestamp":"2026-09-11T20:05:03.507Z","request_id":"req_011CexFbAxUTKjP1XYeoWGTT"}
